        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John le Carré, David John Moore Cornwell, Tim Winton\n- Works: The Russia House, In the Winter Dark\n- Companies: Goalpost Pictures\n- Topics: Espionage novels, Australian literature, Film adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- David John Moore Cornwell was born on 19 October 1931 and was known by the pseudonym John le Carré.\n- John le Carré is a British author of espionage novels.\n- Tim Winton, also known as Timothy John Winton, was born on 4 August 1960.\n- Tim Winton is a multi-award-winning Australian writer of novels, children's books, non-fiction books, and short stories.\n- The Russia House is a spy novel by John le Carré that was published in 1989.\n- In the Winter Dark is a 1998 Australian feature film adaptation of a novel by Tim Winton.\n- Goalpost Pictures released In the Winter Dark on 10 September 1998.",
